    "features": "<p><em>Commander of Tycho Station, Earther</em></p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Stick Your Neck Out, Take Cover, The Upper Hand, When a Plan Comes Together</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Command (Master), Contacts (Master), Intrigue (Master), Observation (Expert), Pistol Style (Expert), Striking Style (Novice), Tactical Awareness (Novice)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> Hand terminal. Johnson’s rarely armed unless he’s expecting a fight, and likewise rarely armored or suited up for action in space since he’s more often confined behind a desk.</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 1</p>",
